---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base
  title="DMCA & Takedown Policy | Bleepboard"
  description="How to request removal of a sound from Bleepboard. We respond to valid DMCA takedown requests promptly."
>
  <article class="prose">
    <h1>DMCA &amp; takedown policy</h1>
    <p>
      Bleepboard hosts short audio clips for commentary, reference, and entertainment.
      If you are a rights holder and believe a clip on this site infringes your copyright,
      email <strong>dmca@bleepboard.com</strong> with:
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>The URL of the sound page in question</li>
      <li>Identification of the copyrighted work you claim is infringed</li>
      <li>Your contact information</li>
      <li>A statement that you have a good-faith belief the use is not authorized</li>
      <li>A statement, under penalty of perjury, that the information is accurate and you are authorized to act for the rights holder</li>
    </ul>
    <p>Valid requests are honored promptly and the clip is removed.</p>
  </article>
</Base>
